  "confidence_policy": "Primary and enhanced +5 use the agreeing community descriptions. Special retains CONFLICT due to historical .75. Power requires a caller-supplied source parameter with CONFLICT against the uncertain Compendium .8 and Foundry generic .5 fallback; Clarity does not state a power value. Only the synthetic consumer fixture supplies -.2 (x.8) explicitly.",
  "policies": [
    "Exactly one primary_ammo / special_ammo / heavy_ammo tag is required for an ADS contribution. Conflicting or absent ammo tags do not silently choose a class.",
    "Snapshot applies only to the source weapon and its accepted enter phase; it does not change exit, ready, stow or another weapon. Enhanced stability is a separate permanent query contribution, not an ADS-only bonus.",
    "Duplicate Snapshot providers share a family and do not multiply or double stability. Other ADS families may multiply.",
    "Accepted deadlines and traces freeze; subsequent edges read current Handling, buffs and equipment. This is Chorus sampling policy, not an original-game cancellation-window measurement.",
    "Synthetic consumer base Handling 10, exit .1 seconds and damage/ammo/geometry are test inputs. Curves are published community fits; no claim of complete production catalog or visual animation calibration."
  ],
